@startuml
title SplitSmart Critical Flows (Proposed)
actor Member
actor Reviewer
participant Client
participant Application
participant Domain
database Store
participant NotificationAdapter

== Submit and notify ==
Member -> Client: submit expense
Client -> Application: SubmitExpense(command)
Application -> Domain: validate membership, payer, split
Domain --> Application: calculated shares / validation result
Application -> Store: save PENDING expense
Application -> NotificationAdapter: publish new-expense event
NotificationAdapter --> Application: delivered or failed/retryable
Application --> Client: success: pending / actionable error

== Review and balance effect ==
Reviewer -> Application: ReviewExpense(approve/reject)
Application -> Store: check version and reviewer policy
Application -> Domain: transition status
alt approved
  Domain -> Domain: create one approved effect set
  Application -> Store: commit decision + unique effects
else rejected
  Application -> Store: commit rejection only
end
Application --> Client: status and balance-effect outcome

== Payment ==
Member -> Application: RecordPayment
Application -> Store: lock/check current obligation
alt amount <= outstanding
  Application -> Store: record payment and reduce projection
else amount > outstanding
  Application --> Client: reject; no mutation
end
@enduml
